WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.850
- So true or false.

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:04.580
I heard that you stabbed
one of your costars.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.830
So that's weird (laughs).

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.347
- Unfortunately, that is true (laughs).

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.870
So it was my first day on set,

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.150
and it's quite terrifying getting

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:16.020
a big Shondaland Netflix job.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.050
You think, "I just don't
want to screw this up."

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.327
So they said to me, "You're very tiny,

00:00:19.327 --> 00:00:20.980
let's put you in heels."

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.750
And I thought, "Yeah, I'll do anything

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.220
you want me to do, yes."

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.430
It became evident pretty
quickly that with the corset

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.410
and the heels, my balance
was not so amazing.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.800
So I was walking along,
and I fell three times,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.090
and the third time, I
was holding a parasol,

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.260
which in the wrong hands
is a deadly weapon,

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:40.600
and I fell forward and
stabbed Claudia Jesse,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.770
who plays Eloise Bridgerton, in the hand,

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.500
and she just started bleeding.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.620
- Oh my God.
- But she's still my friend,

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:47.710
she's still my friend.
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.610
But yeah, unfortunately,
there was a stabbing

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.090
on the first day, and I was guilty.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.360
It was not good.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.400
- I mean, my thing is if I'm
wearing those long dresses,

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.380
that's the first, anytime I'm on a stage,

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.367
and it's a long dress, I
look at my stylist and go,

00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:02.220
"I want the easiest shoes in the world,"

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.150
because they can't even

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.370
see your feet.
- Yes.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.390
- So I don't even know why--

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.180
- Just throw yourself
on the ground, Kelly,

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.190
that's all you need to do.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.340
Just be like oops,
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.173
throw yourself over,

00:01:10.173 --> 00:01:11.819
and you'll never have to wear heels again.

00:01:11.819 --> 00:01:14.553
- Yeah, well and at some
point I just learned no.

